{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o068b","title":"刘备进猇亭马良抚五溪黄权拒吴","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o068b-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘备自秭归进军驻猇亭，遣马良安抚五溪获得响应，黄权督江北诸军在夷陵道拒吴。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o068b-q"]},{"id":"dongliu-a-a8bd2af11f9dd77f5ec8","label":"正文","text":"刘备遣马良入武陵招纳五溪蛮夷","evidence":["dongliu-q-1faec6e7da7aae6ba68f"]},{"id":"huangli-a-36e66d05c61cb055ed0c","label":"正文","text":"刘备以黄权为镇北将军督江北","evidence":["huangli-q-3cfca8ff71f614717fb4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"驻营","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o068b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0121","role":"抚五溪","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o068b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0062","role":"督江北军","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o068b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"猇亭、武陵、夷陵道","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o068b-q"]},"time":{"year":222,"label":"章武二年二月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y222","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o068","basis":"章武二年二月"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o068b-q","xianzhu-q-o068","xianzhu-q-b-e2b85eacbc16310809ee"]},"source_order":[32,402,"O068b"],"order":6611}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0062","name":"黄权","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0121","name":"马良","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongliu-q-1faec6e7da7aae6ba68f","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-7239366a53921085f610","layer":"original","quote":"及东征吴，遣良入武陵，招纳五溪蛮夷；蛮夷渠帅皆受印号〖28〗，咸如意指","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":12,"end":47},{"id":"huangli-q-3cfca8ff71f614717fb4","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-5d7b868f4daa79fd6c83","layer":"original","quote":"以权为镇北将军，督江北军以防魏师","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":12,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":59,"end":75},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o068b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-8136daaf302c35b9c188","layer":"original","quote":"二月，先主自秭归率诸将进军，缘山截岭，于夷道猇亭﹝二﹞驻营〖9〗。自佷山﹝三﹞通武陵〖10〗，遣侍中马良安慰五溪蛮夷〖11〗，咸相率响应。镇北将军黄权督江北诸军，与吴军相拒于夷陵道。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":38,"end":129},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-e2b85eacbc16310809ee","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-e2b85eacbc16310809ee","layer":"modern","quote":"〖7〗二年：章武二年（公元 222）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":413,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-18295fa1c5ff11c612db","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o068","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-8136daaf302c35b9c188","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖7〗，先主军还秭归；将军吴班、陈式水军屯夷陵，夹江东西岸〖8〗。二月，先主自秭归率诸将进军，缘山截岭，于夷道猇亭﹝二﹞驻营〖9〗。自佷山﹝三﹞通武陵〖10〗，遣侍中马良安慰五溪蛮夷〖11〗，咸相率响应。镇北将军黄权督江北诸军，与吴军相拒于夷陵道。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":129}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
